# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Practice-identifying assets.
#
# A letterhead and a signature identify a real clinician and a real practice.
# They are loaded at runtime through Document setup / Signature block and are
# stored in the browser's local storage, never in the repository. Keep it that
# way so the project can be shared or published without carrying anyone's
# identity with it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
letterhead*.png
letterhead*.jpg
letterhead*.jpeg
*signature*.png
*signature*.jpg
*signature*.jpeg
*signature*.svg

# ...except the generic placeholder the app ships with.
!public/signature-placeholder.svg
public/letterhead*
src/assets/letterhead*
